# ... except the reference faces deliberately shipped with the repo. The
# patterns above exist for fonts EXTRACTED out of datasheets by dslib/pdf/fonts.py,
# which are artifacts; dslib/pdf/fonts/ is source. Without this negation the
# bundle is silently absent from a fresh clone and `_find_reference_fonts` falls
# back to whatever fontconfig returns -- which is the host-dependence the bundle
# exists to remove, reintroduced invisibly. (The language-model corpus hit the
# same trap via the bare `data` pattern and had to be moved out of dslib/pdf/data/.)
!dslib/pdf/fonts/*.ttf
!dslib/pdf/fonts/*.otf

